31,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Good morning! I slept great! Did anyone have any spooky dreams? @Victoria @Mizuki @Toshio @Shion, did the Seer find something? Tell me, tell me! I'm so ready to find the wolf!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Mizuki"",""Toshio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, please be patient. The Seer may not wish to reveal their identity or findings immediately, as doing so would make them a target. We should wait and see who chooses to speak first.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, your excitement is as high as ever. @Victoria is correct; revealing the Seer's identity too early is risky. However, I believe we should start by analyzing any claims that emerge. Does anyone have information to share?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with Mizuki. If the Seer has found a werewolf, they must weigh the benefit of the information against the risk of being targeted. I'll be watching to see who is too eager to lead the conversation.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, you're already looking for someone ""too eager."" How convenient. I'm more interested in who stays silent or deflects. If the Seer found a wolf, the silence is quite telling. Who's hiding something?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're always talking about hiding things! It's making me a little nervous! Maybe the Seer is just shy? @Victoria, do you think the Seer is shy? I want to know who the bad guy is right now!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, it is not necessarily shyness, but strategy. A Seer must be cautious. @Shion, your focus on silence could be interpreted as an attempt to pressure others into revealing themselves prematurely. I find that quite interesting.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Victoria, that's a sharp observation. @Shion, by pressuring the Seer to speak, you might be trying to force a reveal to identify the Seer for the werewolf. Let's stay calm and look for actual evidence rather than just pressure.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, @Mizuki, your points are well-taken. @Shion, your eagerness to point out silence is a pattern I've noted. Are you trying to provoke a reaction, or are you simply impatient? I'm evaluating the intent behind your questions.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Mizuki"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, you're overanalyzing my intent to avoid analyzing the facts. I'm simply testing the waters. If you're all so focused on my ""pattern,"" you're ignoring the void where the Seer's information should be. Who's actually contributing data?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're being a big meanie! Everyone is just trying to be careful! Maybe the Seer is waiting for the perfect moment to surprise us! I bet it'll be like a magic trick! Who's the most suspicious now? I'm guessing!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, guessing is dangerous. @Shion, you continue to push for data that may not be safe to reveal. I am wondering if this urgency is a tactic to isolate the Seer. Does anyone actually have a lead?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Victoria, I agree. @Shion's insistence on ""data"" while providing none of their own is becoming a pattern. Since I am the Seer, I can confirm that Shion is human. This removes one possibility, but we must remain vigilant.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, thank you for revealing yourself and your result. @Shion, you are confirmed human, but your aggressive approach remains a point of interest. I will now focus on whether others' reactions to this reveal are consistent.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, a bold move to reveal yourself so early. I appreciate the confirmation, though it doesn't change my approach. Now that the Seer is out, let's see who tries to discredit them or deflect. @Victoria, @Toshio, any thoughts?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Victoria"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, you're the Seer?! That's so cool! It's like a real magic trick! @Shion is a good guy, so that means the wolf is still hiding! I'm gonna find you, Mr. Wolf! I'm watching everyone!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, thank you for the information. Since Shion is human, the wolf is among the remaining three of us. @Toshio, @Rin, and I. We must now carefully evaluate who among us is acting out of character.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shion"",""Toshio"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Victoria, exactly. With Shion confirmed, the pool of suspects is smaller. @Toshio, @Rin, and @Victoria, please be mindful of your logic. I will be observing your reactions to this narrowed list very closely.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Shion"",""Toshio"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, @Rin, the focus is now on us. I will remain consistent in my approach. @Mizuki, as the Seer, your next divination will be critical. I'll be watching for any attempts to cast doubt on your role.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, @Toshio, you both seem very comfortable with the narrowed list. Too comfortable, perhaps. @Mizuki, since you've stepped into the light, the wolf's only move now is to blend in or lie. I'll be watching for the first crack.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Toshio"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
