64,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Oh no! Toshio is gone! And Mizuki too! This is so scary, it's like a real horror movie! Who could do such a mean thing?! @Victoria @Shion, are you guys okay? I'm shaking!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki"",""Victoria"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, please try to stay calm. It is a tragedy that we lost both Toshio and our Seer in one night. @Shion, we are the only ones left besides Rin. We must think clearly to find the wolf.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Toshio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, your composure is almost too perfect. Mizuki was killed immediately after revealing themselves, which is the most logical move for a wolf. Now it's just us and Rin. Between the two of you, who is the outlier?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Mizuki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, why are you being so scary again?! I'm just a little girl and I'm super scared! @Victoria is being nice and helping me! I don't want to be the outlier, I just want the mean wolf to go away!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, it is alright to be afraid, but we must rely on reason now. @Shion, my composure is a result of the gravity of our situation. If we panic, the wolf wins. Who do you suspect?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, you ask who I suspect while maintaining that same sterile distance. @Rin is acting exactly as expected, but you are playing the role of the ""rational guide"" perfectly. It's a convenient mask for a wolf.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, stop it! You're being a big bully to Victoria! She's just trying to be a grown-up and help us! Why are you always picking on people? I think you're the mean wolf for making us fight!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, please don't let your emotions cloud your judgment. @Shion, your suspicion is based on my personality, not on evidence. If you execute me based on a ""mask,"" you risk losing the game. Who is the real threat here?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your sudden shift to accusing me is a classic deflection. @Victoria, you're hiding behind ""reason"" to avoid giving any actual leads. One of you is lying. Logic dictates the wolf is here.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're just mean! You're trying to make us fight so you can win! I'm not deflecting, I'm just sad and scared! @Victoria is the only one being nice! I'm voting for the bully!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, I appreciate your support, but we must be certain. @Shion, you have based your entire argument on my demeanor. If you are human, your logic is flawed; if you are the wolf, your aggression is a shield.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, your attempt to frame my logic as ""flawed"" is a desperate play. @Rin, your emotional outbursts are a perfect screen. However, the wolf's goal is to survive, and you're both playing your parts too well. I'll trust my eyes.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
